text = "FLOATSTONE   difficulty 2/5\nfrom: mined\n\nPumice so light it drifts. Fans, launch ramps and field projectors blow it off course. Floats in water and magma.\n\nCHALLENGE: Needs covered belts and roofed chutes. Being buoyant, it rides the Magma Bath's weir and splits itself from heavy ore."

