text = "FROST CRYSTAL   difficulty 3/5\nfrom: mined\n\nNearly frictionless, and always cold. Belts slide out from under it instead of carrying it. It chills whatever it touches.\n\nCHALLENGE: Belts can't move it: push it with tube walls, paddles or gravity. Heat turns it to water, salt melts it, and it's the best coolant."

